00:22:26,300 --> 00:22:48,920
And so I'm going to apply that update rule to this node, which will fix whatever property is stored in there. Maybe there's more than one property. And then I'll apply it to this node. And because this is already correct by induction, and this is already correct because I didn't touch this subtree, it's unchanged, then I can update the value at this node, the property at this node, in constant time.
应用规则修复其中属性。可能不止一个。已在常数时间更新。

