00:23:11,700 --> 00:23:22,490
This is very powerful. Data structure augmentation is super useful. You will use it on your problem set. We will use it again today. Let me give you some examples of subtree properties.
非常强大！子树增广超级有用。你们会在作业中用到。举一些例子。

