what is the maximum value in these nodes? You can take any property. It doesn't have to be key. It doesn't have to be anything in particular. This is very powerful. You can take all sums, products, and maintain them as long as they're downward looking, as long as you're only thinking about the subtree.
任何属性都行——和、积，只要向下看只考虑子树。

