00:30:39,560 --> 00:30:52,180
So we're exploiting redundancy. So if you wrote down the traversal order in an array, there's exactly one representation of a given order. But in a tree, there's many representations. It could be a long line. It could be a balanced thing.
利用冗余性——数组中一种表示，树中多种。

148
00:30:52,660 --> 00:31:06,770
They could represent the exact same order on the nodes if you label them right. In fact, there are exponentially many different representations of the same thing. And we're going to exploit that, the same order, and define this is just a thing you need to know.
指数多种表示同一顺序。

