不影响之前工作，是重新平衡的工具。

159
00:33:29,010 --> 00:33:40,320
Notice how deep things are in the tree changes. Our problem with this linear tree is that there are some nodes of linear depth. We want to get rid of those.
深度变化。线性树的问题。

160
00:33:41,000 --> 00:33:53,060
How? So if you take these edges and start rotating them up, if you look at depths, in this picture, A and B are deeper than C. And in this picture, B and C are deeper than A.
旋转后它们交换深度。

161
00:33:53,520 --> 00:34:15,199
So there's a trade -off. This one moved up. This one moved down. This one stayed at the same depth. So hopefully, if A is too deep and C is too shallow, they can trade off like this. It may sound difficult, but in fact, there's a pretty simple way which are called AVL trees
有取舍。有简单方法叫AVL树。

