00:35:57,160 --> 00:36:07,280
k plus 2. Good. What's the longest path from this node to a leaf? Well, it could go through this subtree. And that would be length k plus 1, because it's k in here plus 1 for this edge.
k+2。最长路径长度k+1。

173
00:36:07,700 --> 00:36:10,200
Or it could be through here, and that's k plus 1 plus 1.
或k+1+1。

174
00:36:12,420 --> 00:36:31,220
So the height, if I told you the height of these subtrees, we can derive the height of this node. We're going to use that a lot in a moment. So first claim is that if I could maintain height balance, then I will guarantee that h equals log n. So in other words, height balance implies balance.
高度平衡保证h=log n。

175
00:36:32,420 --> 00:36:41,940
So let's prove that first quickly. And then the interesting part is, how do we actually prove that?
先证明。

176
00:36:45,180 --> 00:36:51,480
Or how do we actually maintain the balance property? We're going to do that using rotations. But how is a big question.
如何用旋转维护？

177
00:37:01,340 --> 00:37:03,940
OK. So why does height balance

178
00:37:06,900 --> 00:37:07,610
imply balance?

179
00:37:16,740 --> 00:37:30,020
So what this is saying is that all height balance trees have logarithmic height. So what I'd like to think about is the least balanced height balance tree.
所有高度平衡树都有对数高度。考虑最不平衡的情况。

180
00:37:30,760 --> 00:37:40,900
The least balanced one is going to have, at every node, a mismatch. Let's say the left subtree is shallower than the right subtree by 1.
每个节点左子树比右子树浅1。

181
00:37:41,840 --> 00:37:44,800
So it's going to be inversively all the way down. So every node has a gap,

182
00:37:46,980 --> 00:37:52,620
a skew of 1,

183
00:37:55,100 --> 00:38:03,400
which I'm going to write. I'm going to introduce some notation. I'll write a descending rightward arrow if this one is higher than the left subtree.
引入符号。

184
00:38:06,110 --> 00:38:10,100
So the easy way to think about this is, this is sort of our worst case.
这是最坏情况。

185
00:38:40,440 --> 00:38:54,720
do data. has height h minus 1. So how many nodes are in here? Well, this is a recurrence I'm going to write. So this will be n sub h minus 2. This will be n sub h minus 1.

186
00:38:55,460 --> 00:39:05,140
And then I just count how many nodes are in this picture. It is n sub h minus 1 plus n sub h minus 2 plus 1, or this node.
节点数：N_{h-1}+N_{h-2}+1。

187
00:39:05,740 --> 00:39:17,760
Now, you might ask, what is an NH recurrence for? But it is the number of nodes in this sort of worst case for if the worst case has total height h.
N_h是高度h的最坏情况节点数。

