00:40:44,280 --> 00:40:59,860
So this is a true statement. In fact, strictly greater than. Why? Because so I removed the plus 1. That should only make something smaller. And I replaced n sub h minus 1 with n sub h minus 2. Here I'm implicitly using a fact which is obvious by induction.
严格大于——因移除了+1。

